      "created_at": "2017-04-23T19:35:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Happens in non-video games, too. One of the reasons I hated gym class was because of situations where kids very quickly learned stuff like how the easiest way to win was to hit the volleyball at the person with bad hand-eye coordination who was clearly scared of getting walloped with the ball.</p><p>And really, this sort of thing is pretty much why I hate multiplayer competitive video games too. I'm already a scrub who's going to lose on account of being worse at the game, you don't need to rub my nose in it too.</p>",
