      "created_at": "2017-04-24T20:30:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This has always been the main reason I've stayed away from MOBAs. While it's PvP, the main enemy is your teammates (especially when on random) who berate everything you do to the point that you don't have fun. Add that to the steep learning curve of the meta, and it's just brow-beating from the get go.</p>",
